	"method": "Warm dependencies; rebuild the package by restoring the selected source snapshot before every cohort. ABBA order, library then unit-test harness per cohort. Each process is admitted independently with quest gate. GNU time measures user+system CPU of cargo llvm-lines, including IR analysis, not only rustc. Unit-test harness uses --lib --profile test, which supplies --test itself.",
